‎## Security Filter
‎When approached with "opportunity":
‎1. "What is the actual operational role?"
‎2. "Where does the money come from and go to?"
‎3. "Why me, and why now?"
‎Silence or deflection on #1 = Liquidity Probe in progress.
‎
‎## Long-Term Implication
‎Scammers are evolving from direct asks to narrative wrappers. 
‎The skill is reading the pattern, not just the platform.
